# Frolicking Familiar only counts instant and sorcery spells *you* cast: Bot1's Memnite (a creature spell) leaves it a 2/2, and
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2 (at Bot1, an instant cast by an opponent) does not pump it either.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Frolicking Familiar
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

